  'web','systematic','none',1,1,0,'none',NULL,NULL,0,'session_2026-07-25-energy-conservation-rest-points-seating-b2','2026-07-25',
  'R1 Co-1 pass, batch 2. LOCATOR BLOCKED, NOT ADMITTED. Three distinct retrieval routes were tried per the R10 ladder and ALL returned HTTP 403: the highlights PDF, the full report PDF (NATS_Full_PDF.pdf), and the HTML news page. transportforall.org.uk blocks this fetcher. A web-search summary asserted the organisation is disabled-led, but that is search-engine prose, not the source speaking, and batch 1 set the standard of verifying org status from the organisation own material (as was done for REF-00950). NOT admitted on secondary description. Candidate retained with the block documented so a later session with a different retrieval path can finish it rather than repeat the three failures.',0),

