  'R2 backward-mining lead from REF-00950 resolved. Highest-value single admission of the batch: supplies the primary evidence base for seat dimensions that batch 1 could only anchor on Co-1 against a T5 standard, and independently reaches the same plural-height conclusion. Contains the equity/harm finding recorded separately.',1),

