  'pubmed','systematic','forward',19,15,5,'partial','["REF-00955","REF-00956","REF-00957","REF-00958","REF-00959"]',NULL,0,'session_2026-07-25-energy-conservation-rest-points-seating-b2','2026-07-25',
  'THE GAP-306 INDEPENDENCE TEST, and it resolves the gap. Well-formed three-concept query (contrast with the 7-8 concept AND-chains that returned zero in batch 1). 19 records, 15 screened, 5 admitted from FIVE separate research groups in SIX countries - Canada, Czech Republic (Latvian co-author), France, Hong Kong, United States - none Finnish and none sharing authors with the Jyvaskyla cluster. Methods are also independent of each other: GPS route measurement, population survey with ordinal regression, formal spatial accessibility model, qualitative social-ecological interviews, and a validated audit instrument at n=3,677. The resting-places association is therefore NOT an artefact of one group or one cohort. Remaining 4 records unscreened, available to batch 3.',0),

